---
args: {"acts": "AttributedAct[]", "cases": "DecisionCase[]", "prior": "LedgerDecision[]"}
returns: "LedgerDecision[]"
---
For each attributable authorized adoption, bind its proposition, scope, accountable owner and original author to the supported case identity. Keep a statement's local exception and validity interval. A similar project name alone does not merge decisions. Add a new revision only when an adopted meaning or effective scope changes; retain the old revision and any unclosed objection. Return existing decisions unchanged where the source contains only proposals or assent without required adoption.
